{"title":"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For complex number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c963e8fe9fc399951c69898689d3547c1f97ce29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = a+bi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efe900366502655be6aff4ddc5157a0d3734451d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v = c+di$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" /> (where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/75952e52a3dc061d24146c0df9062a54a5ce5a5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=\\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" />), define the binary operation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce6f19c8e5b2485d1232ece619dc3eee4267e621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u \\otimes v = ac + bdi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a complex number such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a4596897a10678b17ca3cbb31c509e5c6131beb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z\\otimes z = z^{2}+40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/8/77888cf7d3c4635b8bc8c06ee89dc2a2d2f86538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|z|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/8/27875982af2c53df49fc5055a3421bbaa5b74cc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }5\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\sqrt{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\sqrt{10}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }5\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"419\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/615e780fda439b2829922a704a60b31c5ed77191.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+bi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c828beca5a371d95df04a25615cd454763b09a93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z \\otimes z = a^{2}+b^{2}i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>This is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/0/35010e0e866c69b24f22e044996960c2c47ba681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^{2} + 40 = a^{2}-b^{2}+40+2abi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"233\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since the real values have to be equal to each other, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/9/279c75fd67a1c22226755d079ab6fac1263dc5cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2}-b^{2}+40 = a^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" />.\nSimple algebra shows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d18cd513ac3e4a5846a624766e0e41581ea0b142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{2} = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/b/01b3d8fc1b4fd4c9c2c9b1e97ed797a6004bfa55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\pm 2\\sqrt{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>The imaginary components must also equal each other, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/7003649c352fd415b3090a43f2024ade510b81ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{2} = 2ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"68\" height=\"17\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8001670b48cdd67d910642bc830258fc70e863.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2a$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/212238308b21fc226beef01f4d32270a6b299fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{b}{2} = \\pm \\sqrt{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"120\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the magnitude of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85aead5dc4dc5e6e7d6ff18435e6553e41877638.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a^{2}+b^{2}} = \\sqrt{10+40} = \\sqrt{50} = 5\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"285\" height=\"22\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c1c2d054cbadab848c1153c83544e3ee4f6e6ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\text{\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }5\\sqrt{2}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"99\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>~Failure.net\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Yw3W2ptPWYQ\">https://youtu.be/Yw3W2ptPWYQ</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B\">2023 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink